CONSIDER approving in Title 6, Chapter 6-05 of the Los Angeles County Metropolitan Transportation Authority (“Metro”) Administrative Code (the “Code”), otherwise known as the Metro Customer Code of Conduct (“Code”), effective January 1, 2022 either A through D or only E, as follows:

A.	In the Penalty Schedule, replace section “6-05-050.A-I” with “6-05-050.A-E, H, I”;

B.	In the Schedule concerning Violations of the Customer Code That Will Be Addressed Through Ejection, replace section “6-05-050.E-G” with “6-05-050.E”;

